---
// src/pages/index.astro
---

<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>David Arenas | Systems Architect</title>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	</head>
	<body>
		<canvas id="canvas"></canvas>

		<main>
			<div class="content-box">
				<h2 class="label">Strategic DNA • Software Engineering</h2>
				<h1 class="main-title">David Arenas</h1>
				<p class="description">
					Construyo <strong>arquitecturas full-stack</strong> personalizadas para transformar datos industriales y científicos en decisiones estratégicas.
				</p>
				
				<div class="buttons">
					<a href="https://eventanalytics.pro" class="btn-primary">Ver UVEA (SaaS)</a>
					<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/davidarenasr1/" class="btn-secondary">Consultoría a medida</a>
				</div>

				<div class="secondary-links">
					<a href="https://ciencia-ycocina.vercel.app">Ciencia & Cocina Project →</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<footer class="footer">
				FastAPI • Astro • Supabase • Industrial Analytics
			</footer>
		</main>

		<script>
            // ... (Tu código de partículas actual)
        </script>

		<style is:global>
			/* Mantengo tu base y añado los toques de UX */
			html, body {
				margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
				background-color: #050505; /* Un negro más profundo */
				overflow: hidden;
				display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
				font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
			}

			.main-title {
				color: white;
				font-size: 48px;
				font-weight: 700;
				margin: 0 0 10px 0;
				letter-spacing: -1px;
			}

			.content-box {
				max-width: 700px;
				padding: 40px;
				z-index: 10;
			}

			.label {
				color: #3b82f6;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 5px;
				font-size: 11px;
				margin-bottom: 10px;
				opacity: 0.8;
			}

			.description {
				color: #a1a1aa;
				font-size: 20px;
				font-weight: 300;
				line-height: 1.6;
				margin-bottom: 45px;
			}

			.buttons {
				display: flex;
				gap: 15px;
				justify-content: center;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
			}

			.btn-primary {
				background: #3b82f6; /* Color de acción para tu SaaS */
				color: white;
				padding: 16px 32px;
				border-radius: 6px; /* Bordes más rectos para look industrial */
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 600;
				transition: 0.3s;
			}

			.btn-primary:hover { background: #2563eb; transform: translateY(-2px); }

			.btn-secondary {
				border: 1px solid #3f3f46;
				color: white;
				padding: 16px 32px;
				border-radius: 6px;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: 0.3s;
			}

			.btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }

			.secondary-links {
				margin-top: 30px;
			}

			.secondary-links a {
				color: #71717a;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 14px;
				transition: 0.3s;
			}

			.secondary-links a:hover { color: white; }

			.footer {
				position: absolute; bottom: 30px;
				color: #3f3f46; font-size: 9px;
				letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase;
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
